From 46dc189ccbb5bc98f30dc0863b2aabb9cb1c1db5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 15:05:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/9] Load gallery photos through the authenticated endpoint

The ALMOVA server keeps progress photos in private storage and serves them
only to their owner at /api/v2/gallery/{id}/file/, so a public /media/ URL
no longer resolves. The gallery now downloads the file with the
authenticated client (token refresh included) and shows it from memory.
A downloaded photo stays cached for five minutes after the last widget
showing it is gone; the cache key includes the storage path, so a replaced
file is fetched again. The error shows while Riverpod retries.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
